 service (serves UI on http://localhost:3000):\n      ```bash\n      make frontend\n      ```\n  - Running all at once without full dev environment:\n    ```bash\n    make run_cli\n    ```\n  - To troubleshoot frontend build issues or rebuild everything:\n    ```bash\n    make run_clic\n    ```\n\n- Documentation Build (optional):\n  - From project root, run:\n    ```bash\n    cd docs\n    yarn install\n    yarn start\n    ```\n  - Serves documentation UI on http://localhost:3001/ (may prompt for alternate port).\n\n- Testing:\n  - To run backend unit tests:\n    ```bash\n    make unit_tests\n    ```\n  - For running individual test file (especially if some tests fail under `make`):\n    ```bash\n    uv run pytest src/backend/tests/unit/test_database.py\n    ```\n  - Additional test types exist (integration_tests, coverage, tests_frontend) but require extra setup not covered here.\n\n- Important Environment Variables:\n  - `LFX_DEV`: enables dynamic component loading and live reload for backend.\n\n- Notes/Quirks:\n  - Use `uv run git` commands for commits if pre-commit hooks are installed.\n  - Some files (e.g., `uv.lock`, `src/frontend/package-lock.json`) may change during builds and should be excluded from git commits by contributors.\n  \n[/Key Information]', 'Get File Info', True)
